A comment span on a description or note marker line closes below its column

```
- a
  :: u
  : %%%
%%%
c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <dl>
      <dt>u</dt>
      <dd></dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>c</p>
```

```
- a

  [^n]: %%%
%%%
c
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<p>c</p>
```

